    "SE-SCHEMA-N10 schema identity count not three",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N11 unresolved local reference count nonzero",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N12 continuation partition count mismatch",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N13 illegal intra-atomic-case checkpoint acceptance",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N14 conditional false-branch continuation acceptance",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N15 DAG cell substituted into Möbius record",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N16 Möbius cell substituted into DAG record",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N17 installed wheel or sdist byte identity mismatch",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N18 installed surface order or origin mismatch",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N19 feasibility projection missing or duplicate study",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N20 regression count mismatch",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N21 final manifest record order mismatch",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N22 final manifest bound or Stage F boolean mismatch",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N23 non-PASS manifest entry",
    "SE-SCHEMA-N24 floating representation of an authority integer"
